    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The classic arcade revival returns\u2014\u201cFantasy Silken Metamorphosis 2\u201d is here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Pierce through the mist and once again trace the line of fate<br>\u2726 The dynamic Absolute Territory blooms at the trembling of your fingertips\u2500\u2500</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Gameplay\u3011\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u25c8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2656 Move: W (\u25b2) / A (\u25c0) / S (\u25bc) / D (\u25b6)<br>\u2656 Cut silhouette: Left Mouse Button (Z / Spacebar)<br>\u2656 Boss Skill: Right Mouse Button (X / Enter)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u265c Move and slice to control your character, drawing lines to enclose and unlock the hidden forbidden image beneath the shadow.<br>\u265c Domination Stage Skill - Soul Scythe Tempest: Boost all speeds, slashing through enemies with ease<br>\u265c Extermination Stage Skill - Evil Eye Stare: Freeze all enemies on the battlefield with a single glance</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Features\u3011\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u25c8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 Fantasy Reawakened<br>Angels whisper gently, demons laugh seductively\u2014new faces, new encounters\u2026 Who will awaken your deepest desires?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 Revealing the Veil<br>Stroke by stroke, lift the mist from her clothes; a gentle touch brings blazing surprises</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 Dynamic Beauty<br>All-new animated CGs shake both the senses and the heart at the moment of conquest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 Blood-Boiling Action<br>Continue the freeform, skill-based gameplay of the previous title with layered strategy and reflex</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 Dual Paths of Tactics<br>Sneaky breakthrough or brute force assault\u2014choose your route and take control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 Ultimate Collection<br>Full CG gallery and memory mode to relive every unforgettable encounter with her</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Special Thanks\u3011\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u25c8<br>Music provided by: \u9b54\u738b\u9b42<br><br>\u3010Notice\u3011\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u25c8<br>This work was carefully crafted by the renowned intimacy master BangBangKing in collaboration with AI. BangBangKing specializes in diverse and detailed character portrayals and actions. If you are sensitive or uncomfortable with AI-assisted creations, please refrain from purchasing.</h2>",
